WEBVTT

00:00:01.398 --> 00:00:08.236
You all probably already know about us
Season Fairies who control the seasons.

00:00:08.739 --> 00:00:12.937
What? I'm the most wonderful
Season Fairy of all, you say?

00:00:14.177 --> 00:00:15.912
Oh, stop.
You're embarrassing me.

00:00:15.912 --> 00:00:18.282
Nobody said
anything like that!

00:00:18.282 --> 00:00:20.884
You're also beautiful
when you're cold.

00:00:20.884 --> 00:00:22.647
Oh, yuck!

00:00:23.287 --> 00:00:26.957
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:26.957 --> 00:00:29.960
Kuchibiru ni

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:35.296
Namida no rouge

00:00:54.551 --> 00:00:58.221
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:58.221 --> 00:01:05.150
Ai nante, Shiritaku naiwa

00:01:09.032 --> 00:01:12.399
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:12.536 --> 00:01:15.528
Kuchibiru ni

00:01:15.639 --> 00:01:20.633
Namida no rouge

00:01:23.313 --> 00:01:27.017
Mokuyo ni

00:01:27.017 --> 00:01:29.986
Bara o kai

00:01:29.986 --> 00:01:33.922
Tegami o soete

00:01:37.694 --> 00:01:41.565
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:41.565 --> 00:01:44.398
Yume de au

00:01:44.501 --> 00:01:49.495
Anata wa yasashii

00:01:56.079 --> 00:01:59.105
I'm home! I bought a
fresh, hot waffle!

00:01:59.449 --> 00:02:01.883
You want some, right? Sugar?

00:02:03.687 --> 00:02:05.780
Not here. Not here.

00:02:05.889 --> 00:02:08.687
Here it is!
The sheet I set aside!

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:12.229
I definitely have to bring this!

00:02:12.229 --> 00:02:13.821
What's going on?

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:15.532
Oh, Saga!

00:02:15.532 --> 00:02:17.534
Listen, I'm going on a trip!

00:02:17.534 --> 00:02:21.171
All the apprentice Season Fairies
are going on a training trip together!

00:02:21.171 --> 00:02:21.872
-A trip?

00:02:21.872 --> 00:02:22.839
-A trip?
-Yeah!

00:02:23.306 --> 00:02:24.603
Wow.

00:02:31.481 --> 00:02:35.611
It is finally time for you all to
set out on a training journey.

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:39.423
This is also a part of being
an apprentice Season Fairy.

00:02:39.423 --> 00:02:42.993
You will visit many different places
and observe and learn from

00:02:42.993 --> 00:02:46.296
the Season Fairies working there.
This is important training!

00:02:46.296 --> 00:02:49.390
This should not be
treated as a fun trip!

00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:54.304
Hey! Hey! What should we bring for
snacks? We're taking waffos for sure.

00:02:54.304 --> 00:02:55.939
I'm kind of worried.

00:02:55.939 --> 00:02:59.033
I can't sleep on
a different pillow.

00:02:59.176 --> 00:03:01.111
How far are we going?

00:03:01.111 --> 00:03:04.915
I'd like to go to the other
side of the world, at least.

00:03:04.915 --> 00:03:07.217
Do you know about the
other side of the world?

00:03:07.217 --> 00:03:09.617
Everything is
upside-down there!

00:03:09.719 --> 00:03:11.983
What? You're kidding!

00:03:12.489 --> 00:03:16.593
Hey, I told you this is not for fun!
This is for training! Training, you hear?

00:03:16.593 --> 00:03:18.185
Yes, sir.

00:03:19.529 --> 00:03:22.054
Wow. I didn't know
you had such a thing.

00:03:22.732 --> 00:03:25.326
A training trip for
Season Fairies, huh?

00:03:25.702 --> 00:03:28.472
Maybe it's kind of like
our social studies field trips.

00:03:28.472 --> 00:03:30.373
It sounds like fun,
so why not?

00:03:30.373 --> 00:03:33.910
Honestly, Saga.
This is not for fun!

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:37.481
This is strict training in order
to become a full Season Fairy!

00:03:37.481 --> 00:03:40.780
I see. I guess you're a busy girl, too.

00:03:40.951 --> 00:03:42.578
That's right.

00:03:46.256 --> 00:03:48.656
Awe. But I just packed it.

00:03:49.392 --> 00:03:51.361
Look at all the snacks
you're putting in.

00:03:51.361 --> 00:03:53.886
You're not going
for fun, you know.

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:56.797
But I want to eat
them with everyone.

00:03:57.667 --> 00:03:59.336
There, there, don't pout.

00:03:59.336 --> 00:04:01.905
I'll help you get
ready for your trip.

00:04:01.905 --> 00:04:03.907
Really? Waffo!

00:04:03.907 --> 00:04:05.342
Now, what should you bring?

00:04:05.342 --> 00:04:07.944
A change of clothes, right?
Study materials, right?

00:04:07.944 --> 00:04:10.046
-And a lunch, too!
-Ok, ok.

00:04:10.046 --> 00:04:12.480
I hope tomorrow comes soon!

00:04:19.656 --> 00:04:22.147
What?

00:04:22.259 --> 00:04:25.126
-You're kidding! It's time already?
-I tried to wake you many times!

00:04:25.328 --> 00:04:27.888
Put your lunch
in your bag!

00:04:28.198 --> 00:04:31.133
Hey, don't forget your bag.

00:04:31.635 --> 00:04:33.626
Wait for me, guys!

00:04:35.205 --> 00:04:37.574
That girl will be
the death of me.

00:04:37.574 --> 00:04:38.768
Saga!

00:04:42.112 --> 00:04:44.180
What? What's wrong?

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:45.815
I forgot something.

00:04:45.815 --> 00:04:46.543
Smooch!

00:04:47.851 --> 00:04:49.512
A see-you-later kiss.

00:04:51.087 --> 00:04:53.189
I'll be back in a week, ok?

00:04:53.189 --> 00:04:56.993
You'll have to sleep
all by yourself, Saga.

00:04:56.993 --> 00:04:58.461
I know, I know.

00:04:58.461 --> 00:05:00.952
Don't worry,
and go do your best.

00:05:01.531 --> 00:05:03.333
Ok, Sugar?

00:05:03.333 --> 00:05:05.665
Yeah! Well, I'm going!

00:05:08.371 --> 00:05:10.362
See you later!

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:20.784
Hey, look!
The town looks tiny now!

00:05:20.784 --> 00:05:23.987
Wow, we've never
been this far, have we?

00:05:23.987 --> 00:05:25.922
I'm kind of thrilled.

00:05:25.922 --> 00:05:28.758
It feels more and
more like traveling.

00:05:28.758 --> 00:05:30.487
I'm so excited!

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:36.699
Basil, Cinnamon!
Stay in line!

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:39.235
Oh, Sugar! It's not
snack time yet!

00:05:39.235 --> 00:05:41.396
Control yourself a little more!

00:05:41.504 --> 00:05:46.776
Really! Why do we have
to babysit a training trip?

00:05:46.776 --> 00:05:50.837
We can't turn down a
direct request from Elder.

00:05:51.514 --> 00:05:55.348
I'm sure he has a
good reason for it.

00:05:56.753 --> 00:05:58.482
An idea, huh?

00:06:09.032 --> 00:06:10.966
Yum!
This is good!

00:06:11.635 --> 00:06:13.136
This is pretty good.

00:06:13.136 --> 00:06:15.127
Isn't this yummy?

00:06:19.743 --> 00:06:21.845
Ok, pay attention!

00:06:21.845 --> 00:06:23.947
Before beginning this
important training,

00:06:23.947 --> 00:06:27.317
I will now announce how far
your Magic Flowers have grown!

00:06:27.317 --> 00:06:29.019
The big announcement!

00:06:29.019 --> 00:06:30.887
What?

00:06:30.887 --> 00:06:35.025
I want each of you to exert
yourselves in the upcoming training!

00:06:35.025 --> 00:06:36.359
And now...

00:06:36.359 --> 00:06:37.917
The Announcement!

00:06:38.395 --> 00:06:40.530
Oh, no. It says
I'm in first place!

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:43.260
What will I do?
I'm so embarrassed.

00:06:44.234 --> 00:06:46.836
W-Why am I last?

00:06:46.836 --> 00:06:48.838
That's a relief.

00:06:48.838 --> 00:06:51.170
Yeah. It's uncool to be last.

00:06:52.042 --> 00:06:54.210
It's not uncool at all!

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:56.946
It's just typical of you.
There's nothing wrong with it.

00:06:56.946 --> 00:06:59.039
There's lots wrong with it.

00:06:59.949 --> 00:07:03.783
I don't care if I'm last! I'll get
better and better from now on!

00:07:05.188 --> 00:07:07.679
Soon, I'll leave you
all in my dust!

00:07:27.711 --> 00:07:29.611
Now it's your turn.

00:07:30.346 --> 00:07:32.507
Yes, sir.
Very well.

00:07:34.384 --> 00:07:36.011
Soft and smooth.

00:07:36.119 --> 00:07:40.146
Mr. Wind, Mr. Wind,
please blow!

00:07:49.265 --> 00:07:50.767
-That's a good wind.

00:07:50.767 --> 00:07:52.428
-That's a good wind.
-Thank you for saying so.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:55.328
Not bad.

00:07:55.739 --> 00:07:57.340
Pepper is great.

00:07:57.340 --> 00:08:00.673
I want to use my
magic soon, too.

00:08:05.582 --> 00:08:07.948
Looks like it's gonna rain.

00:08:14.691 --> 00:08:16.784
Come on. Give it a shot, kid!

00:08:43.686 --> 00:08:45.021
-Knock it off!!

00:08:45.021 --> 00:08:46.079
-Knock it off!!
-Yes, ma'am.

00:08:46.356 --> 00:08:49.689
Yeesh! You have to curb
your mischievous ways.

00:08:51.728 --> 00:08:53.992
That certainly was a shower.

00:09:09.779 --> 00:09:11.974
This needs a little color, too.

00:09:28.398 --> 00:09:30.389
That's pretty.

00:09:34.704 --> 00:09:38.942
Why did you break the spell?
It seems like a waste.

00:09:38.942 --> 00:09:40.610
Because they are clouds.

00:09:40.610 --> 00:09:43.545
Clouds are free, always
and wherever they go.

00:09:47.217 --> 00:09:48.707
Free...

00:09:50.386 --> 00:09:52.589
Everyone else is lucky.

00:09:52.589 --> 00:09:56.025
I want to improve
my magic, too.

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:59.490
They could at least
ask me to help.

00:10:00.730 --> 00:10:02.197
That's it!

00:10:07.737 --> 00:10:09.706
They look really sweaty.

00:10:09.706 --> 00:10:12.140
Hold on. I'll cool
things off for you.

00:10:25.021 --> 00:10:27.190
That made things a
little cooler, right?

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:28.925
What is this?
Snow?

00:10:28.925 --> 00:10:31.894
In this season?
This is eerie weather!

00:10:31.995 --> 00:10:34.862
-Um... It's not like that.
-But it's just about harvest time.

00:10:34.931 --> 00:10:37.456
-I just wanted to help you...
-Hey, are the vegetables ok?

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:38.899
Hey, Sugar!

00:10:39.068 --> 00:10:43.198
What do you think you're doing!
A Season Fairy can't disrupt seasons!!

00:10:44.073 --> 00:10:45.563
I'm sorry.

00:10:50.947 --> 00:10:52.881
I'm exhausted.

00:10:52.982 --> 00:10:57.009
There's still a long way to go, too.
Ah, how depressing.

00:10:58.721 --> 00:11:00.712
-You think so?
-That's true.

00:11:01.524 --> 00:11:06.062
But I guess they're kinda cute.
They're so serious, and direct.

00:11:06.062 --> 00:11:09.365
I feel like I'm looking at a
younger version of myself.

00:11:09.365 --> 00:11:12.528
-Do you really think so, Ginger?
-You, too, Turmeric?

00:11:12.802 --> 00:11:18.241
Yeah. This is how we found
our paths to follow, too.

00:11:18.241 --> 00:11:19.208
-That's true...

00:11:19.208 --> 00:11:20.505
-That's true...
-Excuse me.

00:11:21.811 --> 00:11:22.835
Salt?

00:11:23.513 --> 00:11:26.082
I wanted to ask you
about something.

00:11:26.082 --> 00:11:29.919
What is Cloud Fairy work like?

00:11:29.919 --> 00:11:31.511
Sure! Come with me.

00:11:32.655 --> 00:11:34.520
Ginger!

00:11:35.325 --> 00:11:40.490
Come on. Have a nice night out
on the town with me! Ginger!

00:11:40.964 --> 00:11:42.955
Huh?

00:11:48.237 --> 00:11:51.172
Where is my bed?

00:11:54.777 --> 00:11:56.404
Sugar?

00:11:58.715 --> 00:12:01.650
Did you see?
That's my snow.

00:12:02.151 --> 00:12:04.312
Aren't you proud
of me, Saga?

00:12:09.258 --> 00:12:14.787
That finishes my homework.
Today went exactly according to schedule.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:20.094
Is one day really this long?

00:12:24.007 --> 00:12:25.998
Do your best, Sugar.

00:12:54.637 --> 00:12:57.073
Isn't this town kind of cold?

00:12:57.073 --> 00:12:58.941
What are you
talking about, Salt?

00:12:58.941 --> 00:13:00.966
It's not kind of cold.
It's really cold!

00:13:01.444 --> 00:13:06.313
It's as though winter visited
this town one step early.

00:13:07.917 --> 00:13:09.976
Does this mean...

00:13:10.086 --> 00:13:14.991
This is a northern town.
Winter comes to this area early.

00:13:14.991 --> 00:13:17.293
Do you mean? Do you mean?

00:13:17.293 --> 00:13:19.318
Sorry to keep you
waiting, Sugar.

00:13:21.998 --> 00:13:25.490
Yay! Waffo!

00:13:26.402 --> 00:13:28.427
And now the weather forecast...

00:13:29.572 --> 00:13:33.543
A cold front is moving down
from the northern region,

00:13:33.543 --> 00:13:35.645
so there's bad weather ahead.

00:13:35.645 --> 00:13:40.139
This year's first snow should
fall tonight, if it's on schedule.

00:13:44.954 --> 00:13:46.888
All right! All right!

00:13:48.691 --> 00:13:53.287
Snow! Snow! Snow!
It's time for my turn!

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:56.499
It's finally going
to get cold.

00:13:56.499 --> 00:13:59.469
Snow just interferes
with business.

00:13:59.469 --> 00:14:00.002
Huh?

00:14:00.002 --> 00:14:03.039
I hear it's going to snow tonight.
What are we gonna do?

00:14:03.039 --> 00:14:07.210
What a pain.
The train always stops when it snows.

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:10.346
It-It's not like that!
Snow is wonderful, right?

00:14:10.346 --> 00:14:11.540
It's pretty, right?

00:14:11.948 --> 00:14:15.850
I love snow! All of you
actually love snow, too, right?

00:14:15.952 --> 00:14:17.613
Hey, come on!

00:14:17.854 --> 00:14:21.221
Humans sure do
gripe a lot, don't they?

00:14:21.324 --> 00:14:23.593
What'ya say we teach
them a lesson.

00:14:23.593 --> 00:14:24.582
Yeah!

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:35.830
Sugar.

00:14:36.405 --> 00:14:37.599
Sugar.

00:14:44.413 --> 00:14:46.347
Dear, dear...

00:15:00.363 --> 00:15:03.699
What? The Snow Fairy isn't here!

00:15:03.699 --> 00:15:06.031
What's this all about, Elder?

00:15:07.336 --> 00:15:10.573
The Snow Fairy in
charge of this area

00:15:10.573 --> 00:15:14.441
became delayed while making
snowfall in the neighboring town.

00:15:14.911 --> 00:15:19.849
In other words,
she can't return here tonight?

00:15:19.849 --> 00:15:20.983
Do you mean...

00:15:20.983 --> 00:15:24.587
The first snow for this
town will be late?

00:15:24.587 --> 00:15:26.422
What? That can't be.

00:15:26.422 --> 00:15:30.324
What do you say, Sugar?
Would you like to try to make it snow?

00:15:32.195 --> 00:15:34.356
What?

00:15:34.463 --> 00:15:39.468
What are you saying, Elder?
Sugar is still an apprentice!

00:15:39.468 --> 00:15:44.235
Yes, but right now,
Sugar is the only Snow Fairy here.

00:15:44.774 --> 00:15:50.346
The first priority of Season Fairies
is to control weather on schedule.

00:15:50.346 --> 00:15:55.079
If so, we will have to leave it to
Sugar. What do you say, Sugar?

00:15:55.851 --> 00:16:00.289
B-but I'm still only an
apprentice Season Fairy.

00:16:00.289 --> 00:16:03.520
My magic is sloppy, and...

00:16:03.859 --> 00:16:04.927
-And?

00:16:04.927 --> 00:16:06.929
-And?
-I don't have confidence.

00:16:06.929 --> 00:16:11.764
I see. I was hoping that
you would try your best...

00:16:13.469 --> 00:16:16.461
I see. I guess you're
a busy girl, too.

00:16:18.374 --> 00:16:22.606
Don't worry, and go do
your best. Ok, Sugar?

00:16:26.015 --> 00:16:26.849
-Um...

00:16:26.849 --> 00:16:28.217
-Um...
-What is it?

00:16:28.217 --> 00:16:30.879
I... I...

00:16:30.987 --> 00:16:34.156
I'll do it!
I'll make snow fall!

00:16:34.156 --> 00:16:35.783
Sugar!

00:16:35.891 --> 00:16:40.089
After all, if I mess up the schedule,
Saga will get mad at me.

00:17:06.789 --> 00:17:08.347
Do your best, Sugar.

00:17:09.091 --> 00:17:10.149
Right.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:12.722
Oops!

00:17:15.631 --> 00:17:17.867
Is Sugar ok?

00:17:17.867 --> 00:17:20.028
She doesn't look ok.

00:17:50.366 --> 00:17:51.267
Sugar!

00:17:51.267 --> 00:17:53.135
Pull yourself together, Sugar!

00:17:53.135 --> 00:17:54.363
Shh! Be quiet!

00:17:57.740 --> 00:18:01.335
Mother was probably this
nervous in the beginning, too.

00:18:02.211 --> 00:18:04.076
Isn't that right, Saga?

00:18:09.085 --> 00:18:11.952
Please, snow. Please fall.

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:16.480
Please!

00:18:29.672 --> 00:18:31.264
It's snow.

00:18:35.344 --> 00:18:36.936
Waffo!

00:18:37.046 --> 00:18:39.849
Snow!
It's snow! It's snow!

00:18:39.849 --> 00:18:42.909
-Way to go, Sugar!
-That's amazing, Sugar!

00:18:53.996 --> 00:18:54.985
Huh?

00:18:56.365 --> 00:18:57.389
The snow...

00:18:57.633 --> 00:18:59.123
-Huh?
-Huh?

00:19:01.771 --> 00:19:03.966
But why?

00:19:04.073 --> 00:19:06.776
Her magic to make snow
flakes was successful,

00:19:06.776 --> 00:19:09.301
but her endurance wasn't enough.

00:19:10.079 --> 00:19:13.571
Oh, no. Sugar.

00:19:15.017 --> 00:19:17.008
It was no good after all.

00:19:18.053 --> 00:19:21.614
Now the town's
first snow is late.

00:19:21.724 --> 00:19:24.989
I wonder if I really can
become a Snow Fairy?

00:19:31.033 --> 00:19:33.024
Is this snow?

00:19:39.909 --> 00:19:41.433
Miss Snow Fairy!

00:19:42.011 --> 00:19:45.469
Sorry I'm late.
Leave the rest to me!

00:19:49.118 --> 00:19:51.245
Wow, that's amazing!

00:19:51.353 --> 00:19:55.551
Everything has become so snowy.
What a great Snow Fairy.

00:19:56.058 --> 00:19:59.395
Awe, I still need
a lot of work.

00:19:59.395 --> 00:20:01.063
What's your name?

00:20:01.063 --> 00:20:03.265
Uh, yes. I'm Sugar.

00:20:03.265 --> 00:20:06.962
I'm Snow Fairy... I mean, apprentice
Snow Fairy Sugar.

00:20:07.069 --> 00:20:08.559
Sugar, huh?

00:20:09.772 --> 00:20:11.535
You beat me.

00:20:12.208 --> 00:20:16.008
Um, I'm...
My snow was no good, though.

00:20:41.971 --> 00:20:43.461
Oh, bunnies!

00:20:45.708 --> 00:20:49.371
I saw the first
snowfall last night!

00:20:49.478 --> 00:20:50.513
-Really?
-Wow!

00:20:50.513 --> 00:20:54.950
You're lucky. I waited all night
because I wanted to see it this year.

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:56.218
Me, too! Me, too!

00:20:56.218 --> 00:20:58.854
Hey! That boy saw the first snow.

00:20:58.854 --> 00:21:00.422
Do you suppose?

00:21:00.422 --> 00:21:02.515
It was my snow?

00:21:04.059 --> 00:21:06.391
I look forward to
it every year, too.

00:21:07.096 --> 00:21:10.633
Giving the children
the gift of first snow

00:21:10.633 --> 00:21:13.363
is something only we
Snow Fairies can do.

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:16.739
The gift of first snow?

00:21:16.739 --> 00:21:18.866
Hey, what kind
of snow was it?

00:21:18.974 --> 00:21:21.909
Well, um...
It was pretty snow.

00:21:22.011 --> 00:21:23.501
-Wow!
-Wow!

00:21:24.413 --> 00:21:26.540
He said it was pretty.

00:21:26.649 --> 00:21:28.310
You did it, Sugar.

00:21:29.318 --> 00:21:31.980
Being a Snow Fairy
is the greatest after all!

00:21:44.199 --> 00:21:46.895
I wish I could have
shown it to Saga, too.

00:21:56.879 --> 00:21:59.746
It looks like snow.
What would Sugar say if she saw me?

00:22:02.518 --> 00:22:06.113
Hey! Come back
home soon, Sugar!

00:22:21.070 --> 00:22:24.972
Tsuki no negai

00:22:25.708 --> 00:22:29.178
Mizu ni tokete

00:22:29.178 --> 00:22:34.550
Shiroi namiki-michi mitsuketa

00:22:34.550 --> 00:22:38.509
Hoshi-kuzu no uta

00:22:39.321 --> 00:22:47.896
Nana-iro no hashi o wataru kaze

00:22:47.896 --> 00:22:53.035
Shitte ita yo ne

00:22:53.035 --> 00:22:57.529
Kimochi tsunagu ureshisa

00:22:58.040 --> 00:23:00.175
Sugar Snow

00:23:00.175 --> 00:23:08.183
Kona-yuki mau machi ni yagate

00:23:08.183 --> 00:23:13.422
Kirei na hana saku kisetsu ni

00:23:13.422 --> 00:23:18.121
Anata o omou

00:23:19.795 --> 00:23:24.533
Kokoro o tokasu

00:23:24.533 --> 00:23:28.570
Ai wa, yume wa

00:23:28.570 --> 00:23:35.567
Sono mune ni aruno

00:23:39.915 --> 00:23:40.883
Preview of the Next Episode

00:23:40.883 --> 00:23:42.685
Preview of the Next Episode
Welcome home, Sugar!

00:23:42.685 --> 00:23:46.488
No, no. That makes me
appear too anxious.

00:23:46.488 --> 00:23:50.926
"Oh, I didn't expect you to be
back so early." That's a bit cold.

00:23:50.926 --> 00:23:55.230
"Oh, my! Welcome home, Sugar."
That sounds like Greta.

00:23:55.230 --> 00:23:58.722
Oh, jeesh! Come back
home soon, Sugar!

00:23:58.901 --> 00:24:03.072
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The Next Episode Is
"While Waiting for Sugar"

00:24:03.072 --> 00:24:06.473
Hey, why aren't
you coming home?
